5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hello everyone. I'm not really sure what to say first, but I'll do my best to help. Let's please try to get along and find the werewolf together.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep this civil, Daisuke. While getting along is a nice sentiment, we should prioritize observation over friendship. I'm interested to see how everyone handles the pressure of the first few days.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Shion is right. Let's not mistake this for a social gathering. I'm quite comfortable with the pressure, but I'll be curious to see whose composure cracks first. Who has a strategy, or are we just winging it?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. It's a pleasure to meet you all. I agree with Daisuke that we should be kind to one another, but I understand Shion and Shunichi's points about being observant. Let's try to find a balance.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,George,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I believe a calm and patient approach is best. Let us observe one another's words and actions carefully before we rush to any conclusions. I shall be watching from the sidelines.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with George. Being patient seems like the safest way. I'm not very good at these things, but I'll listen carefully to what everyone says. I hope we can all stay safe.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, your hesitation is noted. While patience is a virtue, too much of it can lead to complacency. I'll be watching to see if that modesty is genuine or a carefully crafted shield to avoid scrutiny.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're already hunting for shields? How eager. While I appreciate the scrutiny, let's not overanalyze a few stutters. I'm more interested in who tries to play the ""perfect observer"" to hide their tracks.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, that's a very sharp observation. It's true that sometimes the most quiet people are the ones we should watch. But let's not be too hard on Daisuke; he just seems a bit nervous.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,George,,"It is natural to feel some tension in such a situation, Midori. However, I agree with Shunichi that we must remain mindful of how roles are performed. I will continue to observe the flow of this conversation.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm sorry if I'm making everyone nervous. I really am just a bit overwhelmed. @Shion, I'm not trying to hide anything, I promise. I'll try my best to be more helpful.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, promises are easy to make but difficult to verify. I don't require your apologies, only your consistency. Let's see if your contributions become more substantial as the game progresses.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, your insistence on ""consistency"" is almost poetic. But let's be honest, the most consistent thing about this conversation so far is how much you enjoy playing the interrogator. It's a bit predictable, don't you think?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, @Shion, please let's not argue. I think we're all just trying to be helpful in our own ways. Maybe we can focus on getting to know each other a bit more before we start analyzing everything?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,George,,"Midori, your desire for harmony is commendable, but we must remember the nature of our situation. A little friction can often reveal the truth more quickly than a polite conversation. I shall remain patient and see what emerges.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think you're all right. I'll try to be more useful tomorrow. I hope the Seer finds something helpful tonight so we can protect each other. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shion,,"A reasonable conclusion for today. I'll be analyzing the gaps in your words tonight, Daisuke. Let's see if tomorrow brings more substance or more apologies. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll be spending my night wondering which of you will be the first to stumble. Sleep well, everyone. I'm looking forward to seeing who's still standing tomorrow.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Midori,,"I hope everyone has a peaceful night. Let's all try to stay positive and work together tomorrow. I'll be thinking of you all. Goodnight, everyone!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,George,,I wish you all a restful evening. I shall spend my time reflecting on our initial interactions and preparing for the task ahead. May the night be kind to us all. Goodnight.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
