34,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
35,1,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
36,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Good morning... I hope everyone slept well. I'm still a bit nervous, but I'm wondering if the Seer found any clues? If it's safe, maybe someone could tell us what they know?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, your eagerness to have the Seer reveal themselves is quite telling. It's a convenient way to expose our most valuable asset early. I'm more interested in who is pushing for a reveal and why.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're practically tripping over yourself to play the protector. It's almost touching. But let's be real: pushing for a reveal isn't always a wolf's tactic; sometimes it's just a sign of desperation. Who's actually feeling desperate here?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, @Shunichi, please let's not be so suspicious of each other so early. @Daisuke is just hoping for a lead to help us. I think we should listen to the Seer if they feel comfortable sharing.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,George,,"I agree with Midori that we should be open to guidance, but Shion's caution is not without merit. A premature reveal can be a dangerous gamble. Let us first see if any contradictions emerge in our discourse.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I didn't mean to put the Seer in danger. I'm sorry, @Shion. I just thought it would be easier if we had a lead. I'll be quiet and listen to what everyone else thinks instead.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, your apologies are becoming a habit. It's a convenient way to retreat whenever you're challenged. I'm not interested in your intentions, only in the patterns you're creating. Does anyone else find this cycle of ""mistake and apology"" suspicious?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, your obsession with Daisuke is starting to look like a fixation. Are you trying to build a case against the easiest target to make yourself look like the most diligent villager? It's a bit too convenient, don't you think?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, I think you're being a bit too hard on Daisuke. We're all under a lot of pressure, and not everyone handles it with the same confidence. Let's try to be more supportive of one another.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shion, while your focus on patterns is a valid method, targeting the most vulnerable member of the group can sometimes be a distraction. Let us consider if this fixation serves the village or merely creates a convenient scapegoat.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't want to be a scapegoat. I'm really just a villager and I want us to win. @Shion, please... I'm not trying to trick you. I'll try to be stronger, but I don't know how to be like you all.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, emotional appeals are the weakest form of defense. Your inability to adapt to the pressure doesn't prove your innocence; it only makes you a convenient shield. I'm wondering if this ""weakness"" is your primary strategy.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're practically writing a textbook on how to be the most annoying person in the room. If you keep treating this like a courtroom drama, you'll just alienate everyone. Is this ""interrogator"" act your only way of feeling useful?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, @Shion, please, let's stop this. It's heartbreaking to see us fighting like this. We should be working together to find the wolf, not attacking each other's personalities. Can we please try to be a bit more gentle?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,George,,"@Midori, your kindness is a virtue, but we must not let it blind us. @Shion, your pursuit of truth is admirable, yet your methods are becoming abrasive. Let us step back and analyze the facts objectively.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't know what to do anymore. I just want us to find the wolf without hurting each other. Since no one has spoken up as the Seer, maybe we should just be careful with our votes today. I'm sorry...","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, your constant apologies are a noise that obscures the truth. Since no one has claimed the Seer role, we are left with behavioral patterns. I find your fragility and Midori's blind defense of it quite suspicious. Let's vote.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you've spent the entire day trying to paint a target on the weakest link. It's a classic move—find a scapegoat and ride the wave of their anxiety. I'm voting for you; your ""interrogator"" act is far too performative.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, @Shion, please don't make this so aggressive. I only want us to be kind, but it's so sad that we're turning on each other. I can't bring myself to vote for anyone I'm not sure about.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,George,,"It is a regrettable state of affairs when we allow personalities to overshadow the objective. While Shunichi finds Shion performative, and Shion finds Daisuke suspicious, we have no concrete evidence. I shall vote for Shion, as their aggression risks fracturing our unity.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Shion"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
