69,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Good morning... I'm so sorry about Shion, even if they were hard on me. But... George was attacked? That's terrible. I'm really worried now. Does anyone have any information? Please, if you're the Seer, we need your help.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"It's a tragedy, really. George was the voice of reason, and now he's gone. It seems the wolf prefers to eliminate those who can actually think. @Daisuke, your apologies are still going strong, but let's focus. Seer, if you're alive, now is the time.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""George"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Midori,,"It's so heartbreaking to lose George. He was such a calming presence for all of us. I'm really scared now, but we have to stay strong. @Seer, please, if you can help us, we're listening.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I feel so bad that George is gone. He was the only one who really understood how I felt. @Shunichi, @Midori, do you think the wolf attacked George because he was too observant? I'm really scared... I just want us to find the wolf.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, your fear is predictable, but let's not let it paralyze us. George's death is a clear signal. The wolf is playing a calculated game, removing the most stable element of our group. It's almost a shame; he was far more interesting than your constant trembling.","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, please don't be so harsh on Daisuke. He's genuinely frightened, and we all are. Losing George feels like losing our anchor. We should support each other right now, or the werewolf will just keep picking us apart.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm sorry, @Shunichi. I know I'm not as strong as you, but I'm trying. @Midori, thank you for being so kind to me. I just... I can't stop thinking that the wolf is still here, watching us. Does anyone have any clues? Please...","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, your gratitude toward Midori is touching, but let's not confuse kindness with innocence. We're down to three people. If the Seer is still breathing, the silence is becoming a liability. @Midori, you're very protective; is that genuine, or just a convenient cover?","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, that's a very scary thing to say. I'm just trying to keep us together because we're all that's left. I promise I'm not hiding anything; I just can't stand seeing us fight while we're in danger.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't want to suspect anyone, but @Shunichi, you're being so aggressive again. It's scary. I really hope we can trust each other, but I'm so confused. If we're wrong today, it's over... I just want us to be safe.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, your confusion is the only consistent thing about you. But look at the facts: we're at the endgame. If Midori is the wolf, she's played the ""kind soul"" perfectly. If it's you, you've played the ""victim"" perfectly. I'm the only one being honest about the tension.","{""words"":47,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, it's so sad that you see honesty only as aggression. I'm not playing a role; I truly care about us. If we spend our last moments doubting each other, the wolf has already won. Please, let's just be honest.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
